OL,3,AGloomy forecast for tenants as rent
OL,4,Arises set to speed up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rising cost of renting a home in
OL,7,Fthe UK has accelerated after a
OL,8,Fthree-year slowdown - with tenants told
OL,9,Fto expect more pain to come.
OL,11,FAverage rental costs for new tenancies
OL,12,Fwere up 2.6% in July compared with a
OL,13,Fyear earlier, according to property
OL,14,Fwebsite Zoopla.
OL,16,FThat remains lower than the rate of
OL,17,Frising prices in general, but the
OL,18,Fproperty portal has forecast annual
OL,19,Frent rises among privately rented homes
OL,20,Fwill hit 4% or 5% by the end of the
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
