OL,3,AGloomy forecast for tenants as rent
OL,4,Arises set to speed up
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said there were fewer homes
OL,7,Favailable to rent and - with potential
OL,8,Ffirst-time buyers put off by higher
OL,9,Fmortgage rates - competition for rental
OL,10,Fplaces in some areas was more intense.
